# Service images build with the repository root as context (see
# docker-compose.yml). A whitelist: without it web/node_modules, data/,
# models/ and .git would all be sent to the daemon on every build.
*
!packages/
!services/
# the delay model package, installed into the predictor image
!ml/pyproject.toml
!ml/busdelay/

**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
**/tests/
**/conftest.py
